VALUES (4400093531020111, ARRAY['"A registration form lets users select multiple skills and one experience level. Which control design respects both requirements?"'::jsonb, '"A table header must label two columns, while a category heading spans two body rows. Which attributes serve those needs, respectively?"'::jsonb, '"A stylesheet change unexpectedly affects every paragraph on a site. Which selector is most likely responsible?"'::jsonb, '"A form submission loses the selected department. All radio inputs have different `name` attributes. What is the most likely markup-level issue?"'::jsonb, '"A page has a button that should submit a form, but clicking it resets the inputs. Which attribute value should be checked?"'::jsonb, '"A link works when the page is at `/index.html`, but not when the same code is moved to `/students/index.html`. It uses `href=\"syllabus.html\"`. Why?"'::jsonb, '"An inline style, an ID rule and a class rule disagree on the same text colour. Which sequence should guide diagnosis before changing values?"'::jsonb, '"A developer places a tooltip beside a button using absolute positioning. It appears in the wrong place after layout changes. Which design change may make the placement more predictable?"'::jsonb, '"A page uses CSS animation on a decorative element and notices excessive movement for some users. What is the most appropriate improvement?"'::jsonb, '"A developer is asked to make a static page containing a heading, paragraph, image with alternative text, list and working links. Which review catches the most important structural problems before styling?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Checkboxes for skills and a single named radio group for experience level"'::jsonb, '"A hidden input for every visible choice"'::jsonb, '"A submit button for each skill"'::jsonb, '"One radio group for every skill and multiple levels"'::jsonb, '"alt=\"2\" and id=\"2\""'::jsonb, '"colspan=\"2\" and rowspan=\"2\""'::jsonb, '"rowspan=\"2\" and colspan=\"2\""'::jsonb, '"href=\"2\" and src=\"2\""'::jsonb, '"An ID selector used on one element"'::jsonb, '"An inline style attribute on a single element"'::jsonb, '"A broad type selector `p` in a shared external stylesheet"'::jsonb, '"A fragment identifier in one hyperlink"'::jsonb, '"The page uses an HTML5 doctype"'::jsonb, '"The table has a thead"'::jsonb, '"The CSS background is a gradient"'::jsonb, '"The radio controls are not grouped under the same name, so their values are submitted as separate fields"'::jsonb, '"The body needs a rowspan"'::jsonb, '"The button/input type may be reset instead of submit"'::jsonb, '"The anchor href must be a CSS class"'::jsonb, '"The page must use UDP"'::jsonb, '"The link''s text must be a heading"'::jsonb, '"The browser no longer supports anchors"'::jsonb, '"The destination needs a row span"'::jsonb, '"The relative URL now resolves under `/students/`, so the path must be updated for the new location"'::jsonb, '"Check importance/origin, specificity and then source order for applicable declarations"'::jsonb, '"Assume CSS chooses randomly"'::jsonb, '"Delete the HTML doctype"'::jsonb, '"Choose the longest selector without inspecting the cascade"'::jsonb, '"Replace the button with a table footer"'::jsonb, '"Move the tooltip text into the DNS record"'::jsonb, '"Give a suitable containing wrapper relative positioning and position the tooltip within it"'::jsonb, '"Use a larger domain name"'::jsonb, '"Increase movement until it becomes familiar"'::jsonb, '"Use flashing text for emphasis"'::jsonb, '"Make animation mandatory in the HTML structure"'::jsonb, '"Respect prefers-reduced-motion and provide a reduced-motion or no-animation state"'::jsonb, '"Choose an animation duration first"'::jsonb, '"Check semantic elements, valid nesting, required attributes and correct link/image paths"'::jsonb, '"Change the DNS TTL"'::jsonb, '"Tune box-shadow first"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

