VALUES (440099110101017, ARRAY['"Which set contains only the four Vedas?"'::jsonb, '"A diagram of Caturdaśa-Vidyāsthāna is required. Which structure best reflects the common course framework?"'::jsonb, '"A student mixes up Nirukta and Vyakarana. Which distinction corrects the notes?"'::jsonb, '"A team has limited time for a BKS project and wants to connect ancient mathematics with modern relevance without overclaiming. Which scope fits the syllabus?"'::jsonb, '"An assignment considers both measurement units and the number system as related topics. Which unit is appropriate?"'::jsonb, '"A case study compares historical water conservation with present-day rainwater harvesting. What is the strongest comparison method?"'::jsonb, '"A student is explaining Purusharthas to a class. Which example best distinguishes Kama from Artha?"'::jsonb, '"Which order places the four Ashramas in their conventional life-stage sequence?"'::jsonb, '"A project topic is ''urban planning and forest management''. Which syllabus area best covers both?"'::jsonb, '"A student wants to study how metalworking and textile dyeing represent different technical practices. Which unit contains both?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Rigveda, Purana, Kalpa, Atharvaveda"'::jsonb, '"Rigveda, Samaveda, Yajurveda, Atharvaveda"'::jsonb, '"Samaveda, Nyaya, Mimamsa, Yajurveda"'::jsonb, '"Atharvaveda, Chandas, Vastu, Rigveda"'::jsonb, '"Four Purusharthas + four Vedas only"'::jsonb, '"Four technical materials only"'::jsonb, '"Four Vedas + six Vedangas + four other knowledge branches"'::jsonb, '"Four Ashramas only"'::jsonb, '"Both refer only to poetic metre"'::jsonb, '"Nirukta concerns calendars; Vyakarana concerns water storage"'::jsonb, '"Nirukta is a Veda; Vyakarana is a Purana"'::jsonb, '"Nirukta focuses on word etymology/explanation; Vyakarana focuses on grammar"'::jsonb, '"Compare a specific arithmetic, geometry, trigonometry or algebra concept with a clearly stated modern use"'::jsonb, '"Claim every modern formula was invented in one period"'::jsonb, '"Skip the source and present a list of names only"'::jsonb, '"Replace mathematical explanation with temple descriptions"'::jsonb, '"CSS3"'::jsonb, '"Communication Skills"'::jsonb, '"Science and Mathematics in Ancient Bharat"'::jsonb, '"Concepts of Life"'::jsonb, '"Identify the specific design, function and local constraints of each system"'::jsonb, '"Judge them by unrelated grammatical categories"'::jsonb, '"Assume modern and historical systems are identical"'::jsonb, '"Compare their names only"'::jsonb, '"Kama concerns grammar; Artha concerns metre"'::jsonb, '"Kama concerns desire/enjoyment; Artha concerns material means/prosperity"'::jsonb, '"Kama means liberation; Artha means rebirth"'::jsonb, '"Both are names of Vedas"'::jsonb, '"Vanaprastha, Brahmacharya, Moksha, Artha"'::jsonb, '"Dharma, Artha, Kama, Moksha"'::jsonb, '"Grihastha, Sannyasa, Brahmacharya, Vanaprastha"'::jsonb, '"Brahmacharya, Grihastha, Vanaprastha, Sannyasa"'::jsonb, '"Sacred ecology and environment"'::jsonb, '"Word formatting"'::jsonb, '"Language components"'::jsonb, '"Number system and units"'::jsonb, '"Introduction to BKS only"'::jsonb, '"Concepts of Life"'::jsonb, '"Engineering, Technology and Architecture in Ancient Bharat"'::jsonb, '"Reading Skills"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

