VALUES (440099110101018, ARRAY['"A student''s notes place Chandas under grammar and Vyakarana under metre. What correction is right?"'::jsonb, '"A presentation claims the syllabus treats ancient Indian knowledge as including both material and philosophical subjects. Which evidence supports that claim?"'::jsonb, '"A local study compares a stepwell-like structure''s function with a modern rainwater harvesting system. Which syllabus connection is strongest?"'::jsonb, '"An assignment asks which goal of life concerns liberation rather than material prosperity. Which contrast is correct?"'::jsonb, '"A researcher must select topics for a history of architecture. Which list is directly given in the syllabus?"'::jsonb, '"Which study plan best integrates astronomical timekeeping and agricultural knowledge?"'::jsonb, '"A student describes a Puranic work as an encyclopaedic source within the course''s classification. Which judgement best fits?"'::jsonb, '"A report on ancient transport should distinguish movement of people/goods from the technology used to produce metal. Where do these topics appear?"'::jsonb, '"A class debates whether Karma and rebirth are the same word. Which statement best respects the syllabus framing?"'::jsonb, '"A student wants to classify a study of how Sanskrit forms and analyses words. Which combination is the best match?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Both are ritual procedures"'::jsonb, '"Chandas is etymology; Vyakarana is language pronunciation"'::jsonb, '"Chandas is metre; Vyakarana is grammar"'::jsonb, '"Chandas is astronomy; Vyakarana is architecture"'::jsonb, '"It excludes historical and philosophical topics"'::jsonb, '"It includes only hardware peripherals"'::jsonb, '"It includes only HTML and CSS"'::jsonb, '"It covers technology and mathematics as well as Karma, Ashramas and Purusharthas"'::jsonb, '"Traditional water management and rainwater harvesting"'::jsonb, '"Vedic metre and pronunciation"'::jsonb, '"Natural language processing"'::jsonb, '"Purusharthas and email writing"'::jsonb, '"Kama rather than Chandas"'::jsonb, '"Moksha rather than Artha"'::jsonb, '"Dharma rather than Jyotisha"'::jsonb, '"Artha rather than Moksha"'::jsonb, '"Email attachments, CC and BCC"'::jsonb, '"CSS gradients, tooltips and web fonts"'::jsonb, '"CPU buses, BIOS and RAM"'::jsonb, '"Town planning, civil architecture and temple architecture"'::jsonb, '"Study only HTML input elements"'::jsonb, '"Study Vedanga Jyotish/calendar concepts alongside Nakshatrara Gyaan and agriculture"'::jsonb, '"Study only the Ashrama sequence"'::jsonb, '"Study printer mechanisms and ports"'::jsonb, '"It treats a Vedanga as a storage device"'::jsonb, '"It contradicts the provided unit title"'::jsonb, '"It fits the syllabus description of Puranas"'::jsonb, '"It confuses Puranas with CSS sheets"'::jsonb, '"Transport and metallurgy are separate subtopics within the technology unit"'::jsonb, '"Neither appears in the provided syllabus"'::jsonb, '"Both belong exclusively to grammar"'::jsonb, '"Both are Ashramas"'::jsonb, '"They are identical Vedas"'::jsonb, '"They are related philosophical concepts but named as separate topics"'::jsonb, '"They are a pair of measurement units"'::jsonb, '"They are HTML tags"'::jsonb, '"Textile dyeing and trading techniques"'::jsonb, '"Ashramas and Moksha only"'::jsonb, '"Water management, irrigation and architecture"'::jsonb, '"Language components, Sanskrit and language-science concepts"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

