VALUES (4400093521030111, ARRAY['"A disk has capacity 1 TB, but the OS displays only one 200 GB volume and the rest appears unallocated. What is the likely explanation?"'::jsonb, '"A PC will not start after a motherboard installation. The outlet works and fans spin, but no display appears. Which staged diagnostic is best?"'::jsonb, '"A computer needs a quiet printer for ordinary office documents and a separate printer for multi-part forms. Which pairing is most suitable?"'::jsonb, '"A technician plans to format a disk because the OS cannot read its partition. What evidence should be checked first?"'::jsonb, '"A laptop is connected to a display through HDMI, and audio is also routed to the display. Which explanation is correct?"'::jsonb, '"A workstation loses time/date settings when disconnected from mains power, but boots otherwise. Which area is worth checking?"'::jsonb, '"A hardware report confuses memory capacity with disk access time. Which correction is exact?"'::jsonb, '"An optical drive reads a DVD but not a CD-RW. What should be checked before replacing the entire motherboard?"'::jsonb, '"A technician must install a second hard drive in a desktop. Which combination must generally be available?"'::jsonb, '"After keyboard cleaning, a key is physically stuck but the keyboard still enumerates normally. Which diagnosis is most targeted?"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"The remaining space is definitely CPU cache"'::jsonb, '"The monitor limits disk capacity"'::jsonb, '"The printer has hidden the other partitions"'::jsonb, '"The disk may have additional unallocated space that has not been assigned to a partition/volume"'::jsonb, '"Recheck internal power connectors, RAM/graphics seating and firmware/hardware indicators one change at a time"'::jsonb, '"Replace every peripheral at once"'::jsonb, '"Change document page margins"'::jsonb, '"Format the old hard drive first"'::jsonb, '"CRT monitor and microphone"'::jsonb, '"Inkjet for quiet non-impact output; dot-matrix for impact multi-part forms"'::jsonb, '"Dot-matrix for both because it is non-impact"'::jsonb, '"Inkjet for multipart impact forms; HDD for paper output"'::jsonb, '"Assume unreadable means empty"'::jsonb, '"Format all connected drives to test them"'::jsonb, '"Confirm the disk identity, backup status and whether data recovery is needed before any destructive action"'::jsonb, '"Remove the PSU fan to improve reading"'::jsonb, '"HDMI can carry digital video and audio, subject to device support and settings"'::jsonb, '"HDMI is a magnetic storage format"'::jsonb, '"HDMI is used only for printer ribbons"'::jsonb, '"HDMI carries only keyboard commands"'::jsonb, '"Optical drive tray"'::jsonb, '"Mouse wheel encoder"'::jsonb, '"RTC/CMOS battery and firmware configuration retention"'::jsonb, '"Printer nozzle"'::jsonb, '"Both measure the screen size"'::jsonb, '"Access time is the number of USB ports"'::jsonb, '"Capacity is the speed at which a mouse moves"'::jsonb, '"Capacity is the amount that can be stored; access time is the delay to retrieve/access data"'::jsonb, '"Keyboard layout"'::jsonb, '"Drive support/compatibility, disc condition and the correct driver or connection path"'::jsonb, '"PSU outlet gender only"'::jsonb, '"CPU arithmetic logic"'::jsonb, '"A display-resolution menu only"'::jsonb, '"Only a free mouse button"'::jsonb, '"Compatible drive bay/mounting, data interface connection and suitable power connection"'::jsonb, '"A printer ribbon and speaker grille"'::jsonb, '"Mechanical key/switch or reassembly issue"'::jsonb, '"Hard-disk partition table"'::jsonb, '"Monitor refresh rate"'::jsonb, '"Network domain resolution"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['3'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

